{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"d51813eeb92e52c116e540460191a340affdfe0ba2e16b4df2e89cff219ae65e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["七位天使掌管最后的灾"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又看见在天上有异象，大而且奇，就是七位天使掌管末了的七灾，因为 神的大怒在这七灾中发尽了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我看见仿佛有玻璃海，其中有火搀杂。又看见那些胜了兽和兽的像并它名字数目的人，都站在玻璃海上，拿着 神的琴，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["唱 神仆人摩西的歌和羔羊的歌，说：",{"text":"主 神—全能者啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的作为大哉！奇哉！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万世","poem":1},{"noteId":10},{"text":"之王啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的道途义哉！诚哉！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，谁敢不敬畏你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不将荣耀归与你的名呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为独有你是圣的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万民都要来在你面前敬拜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你公义的作为已经显出来了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["此后，我看见在天上那存法柜的殿开了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那掌管七灾的七位天使从殿中出来，穿着洁白光明的细麻衣",{"noteId":11},"，胸间束着金带。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["四活物中有一个把盛满了活到永永远远之 神大怒的七个金碗给了那七位天使。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["因 神的荣耀和能力，殿中充满了烟。于是没有人能以进殿，直等到那七位天使所降的七灾完毕了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"-","text":"或译：国","reference":{"chapter":15,"verse":3}},{"noteId":11,"caller":"-","text":"细麻衣：有古卷是宝石","reference":{"chapter":15,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/REV/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}